Thu Nov 12 19:16:28 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of TheNextLevel 0.1 (Red Hat Linux 4.2's
  TheNextLevel-1.1), the original configuration without Red Hat's
  Windows 95 style patch
  * Installed system wide in /etc/X11/TheNextLevel, per-file overrides
    from $HOME; started by thenextlevel-session through FvwmM4
  * Ported to fvwm 2.7 (needs home:caiocco's fvwm2 for the title text)
  * xlock menus, removed modules, Restart, journalctl and xdg-open
    adapted to a current system
  * zsh, emacs, xdm, keymap and control-panel extras not installed
  * Identical icons are symlinked with %fdupes
